    "text": "Jackson County Pilot\nwebsite\nJackson\nWith ambulance service, city needs to balance capability, cost, coverage\nBy Jackson County Pilot Staff,\n16 hours agoI want to begin by recognizing the skill and dedication of the men and women serving on the Jackson Ambulance Service crew. Their work is demanding, and the community is grateful for the commitment they bring to every call. Achieving advanced life support certification was an important milestone and reflects real progress in what our local team can do for patients.",
